    "origin": "HRC-RETAINED broker envelopes",
    "note": "Mechanically extracted by clod from the HRC-retained broker envelopes exported by Astra (wrkq artifact inv-d604db0e-hrc-broker-events.ndjson, 1136 rows seq 1-1136, read-only from HRC SQLite broker_invocation_events). These are HRC-RETAINED projections, NOT the broker raw capture directory (var/run/hrc/bipc/1ad39b1a6611), which was reaped on 2026-09-07 and no longer exists. Native bodies cross-check against the Claude session JSONL exported alongside as f0a873b3-native-claude.jsonl. `events` are the DRIVER-emitted rows replayed by the test; `recordedWindow` is the full broker-side window seq 806-876 for audit and is NOT replayed. The recorded seq 862 submission.cancelled(merged-into-foreign-turn) is the DEFECT and is deliberately absent from `events`: it is broker output, not driver input. Per Astra, the old attribution in this recording is not independent proof of input ownership."
